From 4a7aaedc3cabaa99a5becae31d00fa0c714a75bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard DEMONGEOT <richard@rdem-systems.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 14:49:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 41/59] fix: the 67 golangci-lint findings outside gui

errcheck: Close/Remove/Write results explicitly discarded where nothing can be
done about them. govet lostcancel: the service's backup goroutines cancel their
context when the run ends. ineffassign, unused (dead mail templates and DIDX
magic in machinebackuplib; errUploadAborted moved to the Windows file that uses
it), staticcheck (receiver names, error strings, De Morgan, precompiled
fingerprint regexp, inferred types). nbd: a failed index download panics like
the other CLI errors instead of serving empty data.

ci: lint paths relative to the .golangci.yml in use (gui/api) are resolved.
